    "notes": "The mounds and runestones of Jelling stand on our land: here Gorm and Harald made Denmark. Vejle is a fjord town of farmers and furriers, proud of the old ways and eager for the fight. Kolding and Hedensted stand between us and the greatness our ancestors knew.",
